   |     ^^^^^^
error[E0190]: unhandled fallible value of type '()!'
  --> check_fallible_defer_spawn.bit:23:9
   |
23 |   defer run()
   |         ^^^^^ 'defer' has no caller to receive the error: handle it in place with 'defer { call() catch e { ... } }' (§18.3)
